{"meta":{"ph":"ˈspaɪsi; NAmE ˈspaɪsi","pos":"adj.","stars":"★"},"defs":[{"def":"having a strong taste because spices have been used to flavour it 食物","ex":[{"s":"The barbecue gives it that famous smoky flavour and it comes with a shiny sauce that's very, very spicy!","src":"外研社B2 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"烧烤会给它带来浓烟味 并配有鲜艳的调味料 非常辣!"},{"s":"The combination of spicy, salty, sweet and sour flavours makes Gong Bao Chicken hard to resist.","src":"外研社B2 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"辣味,咸味,甜味和酸味的香味结合,使龚宝鸡难以抵抗."},{"s":"Names of food Notes Hamburger • mix of + cultures Fortune cookie Nachos • chips covered in cheese • made by cook for Gumbo • invented in about yrs ago • a piece of with on it inside cookie • spicy stew • invented in N.O.","src":"人教B3 U3","cat":"renjiao","t":"汉堡食品名称 + 文化 配料 福特饼干 Nachos → 奶酪覆盖的芯片 → 由厨师为Gumbo制作 → 大约20年前发明于 yrs ) 里面有一块饼干 → 辣炖菜 → 发明于 N.O."},{"s":"Or, that those who like spicy food tend to have a hot temper?","src":"人教选必2 U3","cat":"renjiao","t":"或者说,那些喜欢辣食的人 往往脾气很热?"},{"s":"EXAMPLE A: I really love spicy food, so what dish would you recommend?","src":"人教选必2 U3","cat":"renjiao","t":"我真的很爱辣的食物,你推荐什么菜?"}]},{"def":"exciting and slightly shocking 故事、新闻等","ex":[]}]}